
# Design Database Schema for
-- PARKING LOT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

Create Django Models for this db:
- https://www.w3schools.com/django/django_models.php

Register All tables in admin.py
- https://www.w3schools.com/django/django_admin.php

Database Schema Design

ParkingFloor
- floor_number (1, 2, 3)
- parking_capacity (int)
- status (available/not available)

ParkingFloor  (1 - M)  ParkingSlot

ParkingSlot
- parking_floor_id (FK)
- slot_number
- status (available / occupied / reserved)

ParkingSlot (1-M) ParkingSession

ParkingSession
- vehicle_reg_no (not null)
- customer_name (allow null)
- enter_at
- exit_at
- parking_slot_id (FK)
- status (entered / parked / exit)
